# The Dockerfile pins its own compiler (`FROM rust:<ver>`) for the published
# amt-verify binary. In the build context, rust-toolchain.toml would outrank that
# pin through the image's rustup proxy. This is a separate pin on purpose -- bump
# it deliberately, it ships to production. Held by tests/toolchain_pin_test.sh.
rust-toolchain.toml
